/// \defgroup grp_ai_pathfinding AI, pathfinding and skirmish AI
/// \brief Unit AI state machines, groups and group orders, the pathfinder
///        and aerial pathfinder, and player-level and skirmish AI.
///
/// `TheAI` owns the pathfinder and the groups; each unit's AI update module
/// runs an `AIStateMachine`; `TheSkirmishAIManager` manages the per-player
/// skirmish AI. \ref sub_ai_pathfinding describes the layers, how they are
/// created and updated, the differences from Zero Hour, and what this means
/// for modding and remastering. No class pages yet: the main AI classes have
/// no canonical headers.
